# HTTP client for encode_decode_json, for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
#
# 1. Start the server:  go run .      (from encode_decode_json/)
# 2. Click "Send Request" above any request below (or Cmd+Alt+R with the cursor inside it).
# 3. The response opens in a side panel: status line, headers, body.
#
# Syntax cheat sheet:
#   ###                  separates requests
#   @name = value        a file variable, used as {{name}}
#   # @name xyz          names a request, so later requests can use {{xyz.response.body...}}
#   blank line           REQUIRED between headers and body
#
# Data lives in memory, so restarting the server empties the list.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### 1. List users (expect 200 and [] on a fresh server)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/health
